${coreMissing.length > 0 ? `Still need: ${coreMissing.map(m => m.replace(/([A-Z])/g, ' $1').toLowerCase()).join(', ')}` : '✓ Identity locked in'}
- The permanent DNA: Who they ARE, not just what they're releasing
